       fhir:ImplementationGuide.definition.resource.description [ fhir:value "Example of a medical telemonitoring prescription for chronic heart failure.\n\nInputs and values used in this example:\n- Profile: ereferral-servicerequest-telemonitoring\n- Prescription type: telemonitoring-chronic-heart-failure\n- Discipline (SNOMED): 394579002\n- Procedure code (SNOMED): 879780004\n- Diagnosis (SNOMED): 84114007\n- Validity period: 2026-05-22 - 2026-11-22\n- Monitoring plan:\n  * Body weight increase of 2 kg over 3 days\n  * Systolic blood pressure threshold 160 mm[Hg]\n  * Diastolic blood pressure threshold 100 mm[Hg]\n  * Heart rate threshold 110 /min\n- Patient SSIN is pseudonymized\n- Diagnosis detail and general remarks are pseudonymized encrypted text" ] ;
       fhir:ImplementationGuide.definition.resource.exampleCanonical [
         fhir:value "https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/riziv-inami-ereferral/StructureDefinition/ereferral-servicerequest-telemonitoring" ;
